447 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 251 0 R/E(Cellebrite UFED is a mobile forensic extraction solution that enables investigators to lawfully collect and preserve digital evidence from a broad range of smartphones and other mobile devices. It supports multiple acquisition methods, including Full File System \(FFS\) and physical extraction, helping recover deeper device data, including protected and deleted content where supported. UFED solutions are available in flexible formats such as UFED 4PC, UFED Touch3, and UFED Ruggedized Laptop, allowing forensic teams to perform secure examinations in laboratories, offices, or field environments while maintaining forensic integrity.)/Pg 20 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

