endobj

450 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 251 0 R/T(CELLEBRITE PREMIUM - \(WITH UNLOCKS\) )/E(CELLEBRITE PREMIUM - \(WITH UNLOCKS\) )/Pg 20 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

451 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 251 0 R/E(Cellebrite Premium is an advanced mobile forensic solution designed for law-enforcement agencies and forensic laboratories to lawfully access, unlock, and extract digital evidence from a wide range of Android and iOS devices. It enables agencies to scale mobile evidence collection through multiple UFED endpoints connected to a centralized server, improving investigative efficiency, fleet management, and case throughput. Depending on the supported device and lawful authorization, capabilities can include full file-system extraction, access to deleted data and protected application artifacts, and advanced device-access techniques. Its centralized architecture helps agencies manage multiple forensic workstations, reduce backlogs, maintain evidence workflows, and collect more digital evidence in less time.)/Pg 20 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

