453 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 251 0 R/E(MD-RED is an AI-powered forensic analysis platform for recovering, decrypting, analyzing, visualizing, and reporting digital evidence from mobile devices and applications. It supports 2,600+ mobile apps, file-system and image analysis, deleted-data recovery, CDR analysis, malware scanning, GPS and timeline visualization, facial and object detection, OCR, speech-to-text, AI translation, and relationship analysis. It also supports evidence from multiple forensic tools and generates reports in Excel, PDF, HTML, XML, and SQLite formats, helping investigators turn complex digital evidence into actionable intelligence.)/Pg 20 0 R/K[11]>>
