<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 254 0 R/E(Secfore Visualizer is an AI-powered mobile forensic analysis and intelligence platform that transforms extracted evidence into actionable investigative insights. It provides 14+ analysis modules, including unified timelines, cross-app communication analysis, location mapping, UPI transaction tracing, contact intelligence, and person-centric profiling. Investigators can use AI-powered search, OCR, visual analytics, chat analysis, deleted-data views, relationship mapping, and interactive timelines to correlate calls, messages, media, locations, and transactions from a single interface. It also supports forensically sound analysis with cryptographic hash verification and court-ready reporting. )/Pg 23 0 R/K[5]>>
