<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 263 0 R/E(Paraben E3 provides a comprehensive computer forensics solution for collecting, processing, and analyzing evidence from Windows, macOS, and Linux systems, including physical/virtual drives, disk images, email, browsers, chats, social media, cloud data, registry, databases, archives, and memory dumps. It supports numerous forensic image and third-party tool formats, along with mobile and cloud evidence integration, artifact analysis, data recovery, metadata extraction, OCR, indexing, and reporting, enabling investigators to efficiently correlate diverse digital evidence within a single case workflow.)/Pg 32 0 R/K[8]>>
