<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 265 0 R/E(NBFTools NETRE is a digital forensic triage and acquisition software solution for Windows, Linux, and macOS systems. It supports live and boot-based imaging, E01/DD/virtual disk formats, Apple Silicon and Intel Mac acquisition, FileVault-encrypted systems, selective data collection, volatile data acquisition, and user/file-specific targeting. NETRE also helps preserve hashes and timestamps and supports iOS data acquisition across major operating systems, making it suitable for fast and targeted forensic evidence collection.)/Pg 34 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

