597 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 265 0 R/E(NBFTools TRIOS is a digital forensic analysis software for Windows, macOS, and Linux that examines forensic images from computers, servers, mobile devices, USB drives, and cloud backups. It supports major file systems and encrypted images, with automated analysis of browser activity, Registry, macOS artifacts, emails, messages, images, metadata, faces, OCR, and timelines. TRIOS also provides comprehensive forensic reporting in HTML, PDF, XML, CSV, and KML formats, helping investigators analyze large datasets efficiently.)/Pg 34 0 R/K[8]>>
