<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 265 0 R/E(Cellebrite Inspector is a computer forensic analysis solution for Windows and Mac that enables investigators to quickly examine computer extractions and uncover internet activity, downloads, searches, locations, messages, USB connections, system artifacts, and timelines. It supports Windows, macOS, iOS, and Android data, AI-assisted media categorization, encrypted-device analysis, advanced filtering, and customized court-ready reporting, helping investigators efficiently analyze large datasets and identify critical evidence.)/Pg 34 0 R/K[10]>>
