615 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 267 0 R/E(Atola TaskForce 2 is a high-performance forensic imaging hardware solution designed for large-scale evidence acquisition. It can image 25+ drives simultaneously at up to 25 TB/hour, with support for SATA, SAS, NVMe, USB, IDE, RAID arrays, and damaged drives. It provides hardware write protection, automated RAID reassembly, logical and physical imaging, hashing, workflow automation, and remote/network-based acquisition. )/Pg 36 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

616 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 267 0 R/T(ATOLA TASKFORCE)/E(ATOLA TASKFORCE)/Pg 36 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

617 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 267 0 R/E(Atola TaskForce is a high-performance forensic imager designed for fast acquisition from both healthy and damaged storage media. It supports 12+ simultaneous imaging sessions, up to 15 TB/hour, 18 ports for SAS, SATA, USB and IDE, plus expansion for NVMe, M.2 and Apple PCIe drives. Key capabilities include hardware write blocking, automated RAID detection and reassembly, damaged-drive imaging, physical and logical imaging, hashing, case management, and Web API automation. It can be operated standalone or remotely through a Chrome-based interface, making it suitable for forensic labs and field investigations.)/Pg 36 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

618 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 267 0 R/T(ATOLA INSIGHT FORENSIC)/E(ATOLA INSIGHT FORENSIC)/Pg 36 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

619 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 267 0 R/E(Atola Insight Forensic is a portable forensic imaging and data recovery solution designed for healthy and damaged storage media. It supports 3 simultaneous imaging sessions, hardware write blocking, SATA/IDE/USB drives with expansion for SAS, NVMe and PCIe SSDs, and imaging to E01, AFF4, or RAW formats. Advanced capabilities include automated drive diagnostics, damaged-drive recovery, multipass imaging, bad-sector recovery, ATA-locked drive access, low-level artifact searching, forensic file recovery, hashing, and detailed case reporting, making it suitable for both laboratory and field investigations.)/Pg 36 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

620 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 267 0 R/T(PC-3000 PORTABLE PRO)/E(PC-3000 PORTABLE PRO)/Pg 36 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

621 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 267 0 R/E(PC-3000 Portable PRO by ACELAB is a professional hardware-based data recovery and storage diagnostics solution for recovering data from damaged or logically corrupted storage devices. It supports SATA/PATA/USB HDDs, SAS drives, SATA and PCIe NVMe SSDs, Apple Mac SSDs, U.2/U.3, CFexpress, SD/microSD cards, RAID, and logically damaged NAND Flash. With four diagnostic ports and support for up to three PCIe/NVMe devices simultaneously, it provides drive diagnostics, SMART monitoring, sector-level analysis, imaging, hashing, RAID analysis, password removal on supported locked drives, and advanced recovery functions. Its Standalone, Enhanced Easy, and Full-Featured modes make it suitable for both on-site recovery and professional forensic/data-recovery laboratories.)/Pg 36 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

