endobj

628 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 268 0 R/E(PC-3000 Express Professional System by ACELAB is a high-performance hardware-software data recovery solution designed for fast recovery from damaged SATA and PATA HDDs. It supports multiple manufacturers, capacities, and major file systems including FAT, exFAT, NTFS, HFS+, APFS, EXT, XFS, ZFS, and virtual disk images. With four simultaneous recovery tasks, it enables rapid turnaround for urgent cases and is suitable for both small data-recovery laboratories and high-volume professional recovery centers. The system combines PC-3000 Express hardware/software with Data Extractor Express for efficient recovery workflows.)/Pg 37 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

629 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 268 0 R/T(PC-3000 UDMA SYSTEM - HDD)/E(PC-3000 UDMA SYSTEM - HDD)/Pg 37 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

630 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 268 0 R/E(PC-3000 UDMA Professional System is a professional hardware-software data recovery solution for diagnosing, repairing, and recovering data from damaged SATA and ATA \(IDE\) HDDs, supporting 3.5" desktop and 2.5" laptop/external drives. Designed as a reliable everyday recovery platform, it offers an effective balance of performance and cost, making it suitable for small and medium-sized recovery labs as well as routine workloads in larger laboratories. The system includes PC-3000 UDMA hardware/software and Data Extractor UDMA.)/Pg 37 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

631 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 268 0 R/T(PC-3000 SAS RAID)/E(PC-3000 SAS RAID)/Pg 37 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

632 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 268 0 R/E(PC-3000 SAS RAID Professional System is a professional hardware-software solution for recovering data from damaged SAS and SCSI-based RAID storage systems. It supports a wide range of RAID configurations, including Stripe, Mirror, JBOD, RAID 4/5/6, combined RAID levels, and custom configurations, along with Windows Storage Spaces, ZFS RAID-Z, BtrFS RAID, and Apple Fusion Drive. The system combines PC-3000 SAS System hardware with Data Extractor SAS RAID Edition for advanced RAID data recovery.)/Pg 37 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

633 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 268 0 R/T(PC-3000 FLASH)/E(PC-3000 FLASH)/Pg 37 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

634 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 268 0 R/E(PC-3000 Flash is a professional hardware-software data recovery solution for NAND-based storage devices where standard interfaces are inaccessible. It supports USB Flash drives, SD/microSD, CompactFlash, Memory Stick, xD, MMC, monolithic flash devices, voice recorders, and selected older iPhones. Using direct NAND chip access and specialized Flash Readers, it can recover data even when the device controller is damaged. Key capabilities include automatic chip identification, complex NAND analysis, ECC/XOR processing, chip reconstruction, continuously updated memory libraries, and automated recovery workflows, making it suitable for advanced flash-media data recovery.)/Pg 37 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

