<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 269 0 R/E(PC-3000 SSD is a specialized hardware-software solution for diagnosing, repairing, and recovering data from SSDs using SATA, PATA, mSATA, M.2, PCIe NVMe/AHCI, PCIe x16, Apple Mac SSD, U.2/U.3, and CFexpress interfaces. It provides advanced capabilities such as SSD diagnostics, service-information recovery, ROM and microcode operations, translator emulation, password reset on supported drives, direct memory-chip access, defect management, and Data Extractor integration. )/Pg 38 0 R/K[4]>>
