642 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 269 0 R/E(Elcomsoft EFS Data Recovery \(AEFSDR\) is a specialized forensic recovery solution designed to decrypt files protected by Microsoft Encrypting File System \(EFS\) on Windows systems. It can recover inaccessible EFS-encrypted data from deleted user accounts, transferred domains, damaged or unbootable systems, reformatted partitions, and disks moved to different computers. The Professional edition can perform low-level, sector-by-sector scanning to locate deleted encryption keys, making it particularly useful for digital forensic investigators, data recovery specialists, and law enforcement agencies handling encrypted Windows evidence.)/Pg 38 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

