674 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 273 0 R/E(Oxygen Review Center is a secure, browser-based collaborative evidence review platform designed for enterprises, law firms, service providers, law enforcement, and government agencies. It enables multiple users to review, search, tag, bookmark, annotate, and report on forensic data simultaneously from any authorized device. With role-based access, advanced filtering, real-time collaboration, customizable reporting, and on-premises or cloud deployment, Review Center helps technical investigators and non-technical stakeholders work together, reduce investigation backlogs, and accelerate case resolution.)/Pg 42 0 R/K[11]>>
