<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 274 0 R/E(Magnet Axiom Cyber is an enterprise digital forensics and incident investigation platform designed to investigate evidence across remote Windows, macOS, and Linux endpoints, cloud environments, and mobile devices. It supports targeted and remote evidence collection\204even from off-network systems\204along with analysis of physical drives and memory. Investigators can use artifact-first analysis, data visualization, root-cause investigation, YARA rules, MITRE ATT&CK integration, Email Explorer, Mobile View, and IOC Insights to identify and correlate critical evidence. It can be deployed on-premises, in the cloud, or in a hybrid environment, with guided workflows and automated targeted collections to accelerate complex corporate investigations.)/Pg 43 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

