683 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 274 0 R/E(Magnet Nexus is a SaaS-based, large-scale remote endpoint investigation platform designed to help DFIR teams collect and analyze evidence from Windows, Linux, and macOS endpoints at scale. Its lightweight hybrid agent enables targeted or comprehensive collection, real-time artifact insights, multi-endpoint processing, centralized endpoint management, and team collaboration\204including when endpoints are off-network. Nexus can work with cloud-based workflows or Magnet Axiom Cyber for on-premises investigations, giving organizations flexibility over data storage and processing.)/Pg 43 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

