685 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 274 0 R/E(Paraben E3 Remote Imaging is a forensic-grade remote acquisition solution that enables investigators to collect evidence from computers, cloud environments, network locations, and selected application data without being physically present at the device. It supports logical imaging, targeted artifact collection, remote and cloud acquisition, and application-specific data collection, with support for platforms such as Discord, Dropbox, Facebook, Instagram, Skype, Slack, Google Drive, and Microsoft Teams. The E3 Remote Imager supports x86/x64 systems, VPN environments, TLS 1.2 encrypted transfers, and remote acquisition of changing data during active incidents, with collected evidence subsequently processed and analyzed within the E3 platform.)/Pg 43 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

