687 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 274 0 R/E(FTK Connect can also integrate with SIEM/SOAR, case-management, eDiscovery, and other third-party platforms to automatically trigger remote endpoint or memory collection when an incident is detected. It supports scheduled and event-driven workflows, watch-folder processing, automated notifications, and API-based integrations, helping reduce manual work and investigation backlogs. Exterro FTK Connect is a forensic workflow automation and orchestration platform designed to streamline digital investigations for enterprises and law enforcement. It uses a simple drag-and-drop workflow builder to automate tasks such as case creation, evidence processing, keyword searching, tagging, reporting, and exporting.)/Pg 43 0 R/K[11]>>
