<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 275 0 R/E(Belkasoft Incident Investigations is a Windows-focused cyber incident investigation solution designed to help organizations detect, investigate, and understand hacking attempts and endpoint attacks. It analyzes registry data, event logs, system files, remote connections, browser activity, downloads, persistence mechanisms, and malware-execution artifacts to identify attack vectors, suspicious activity, and attacker behavior. Investigators can search, bookmark, correlate evidence, and generate detailed incident reports, supporting faster and more structured incident response.)/Pg 44 0 R/K[6]>>
