697 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 275 0 R/E(Belkasoft Remote Acquisition \(Belkasoft R\) is a remote evidence collection solution designed for incident response and digital investigations across geographically distributed endpoints. It enables investigators to remotely acquire hard drives, removable media, RAM, connected iOS/Android devices, or selected artifacts from multiple endpoints. Agents can be deployed through GPO, WMI, USB, or network shares, with support for local networks, VPNs, and subnets. Investigators can perform selective acquisition, hashing, compression, scheduling, and encrypted data transfer, helping collect critical evidence efficiently while managing network bandwidth. Acquired data can then be analyzed using Belkasoft X, including its Timeline, Connection Graph, Cross-Case Search, and Incident Investigation capabilities.)/Pg 44 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

