699 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 275 0 R/E(Oxygen Remote Explorer is an enterprise-focused remote digital forensics and investigation platform designed for incident response, corporate investigations, and eDiscovery. It enables remote and targeted evidence collection from Windows, macOS, and Linux endpoints, as well as Android and iOS devices, cloud services, and IoT devices. Investigators can collect registry and log data, emails, web artifacts, files, documents, RAM, and mobile/cloud data, with scheduled or simultaneous acquisitions. Built-in Timeline, Social Graph, OCR, image categorization, keyword/RegEx search, and reporting capabilities help investigators quickly identify and correlate relevant evidence while minimizing disruption to end users.)/Pg 44 0 R/K[10]>>
