<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 277 0 R/E(Magnet Witness is a specialized video forensics and evidence investigation platform that enables investigators to acquire, review, analyze, and export video evidence from sources such as CCTV/DVR systems, body cameras, mobile devices, drones, dashcams, and cloud-based surveillance systems. It can directly acquire video from DVR hard drives, including deleted or partially overwritten footage, and supports review of native and proprietary video formats. Investigators can correlate footage from multiple sources, reconstruct timelines, and produce court-ready, auditable reports and concatenated videos for clear presentation of findings.)/Pg 46 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

