714 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 277 0 R/E(MD-VIDEO AI is an AI-powered video forensic and multimedia recovery solution designed to recover, enhance, analyze, and authenticate video and image evidence. It supports video/audio recovery, metadata and channel/time information, object and anomaly detection, vehicle and license-plate analysis, image enhancement, number-plate restoration, face restoration and deepfake detection, and person identification. The solution helps investigators recover critical multimedia evidence and extract actionable intelligence from CCTV, dashcams, drones, body cameras, IoT cameras, and other video sources.)/Pg 46 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

