716 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 277 0 R/E(AI Vision is an AI/ML-powered image and video analytics platform for real-time surveillance, reconnaissance, and threat detection. It analyzes live CCTV feeds and recorded video to provide facial recognition, crowd analysis, object and incident detection, suspicious-behavior detection, and real-time/offline alerts. The platform is designed to help law enforcement, defence, BFSI, and enterprises improve situational awareness, threat identification, public safety, and automated response.)/Pg 46 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

