<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 277 0 R/E(pi-sense by Pi Lab is an AI-powered video forensics and visual evidence analysis platform designed for forensic laboratories, law enforcement, and intelligence agencies. It analyzes CCTV, bodycam, dashcam, smartphone, and social-media video to identify faces, objects, activities, and license plates, while also providing natural-language video search, intelligent event summarization, timestamp and metadata analysis, and video-tampering detection. It can track people and objects across footage, highlight key events, and generate forensic-grade, courtroom-ready reports, with deployment available on-premises or in the cloud.)/Pg 46 0 R/K[11]>>
