<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 278 0 R/E(Amped DVRConv is a specialized forensic CCTV/DVR video conversion software that converts proprietary and often unplayable video files from CCTV/DVR systems, dashcams, body-worn cameras, and other surveillance sources into open, playable formats. It supports automated batch conversion, drag-and-drop processing, customizable codecs and output formats, file splitting/merging, playback-speed correction, and watch-folder automation. The original evidence is preserved, while the software creates a playable proxy and a conversion report, helping investigators and prosecutors review surveillance footage without relying on proprietary players.)/Pg 47 0 R/K[5]>>
