728 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 278 0 R/E(Amped Engine is a command-line CCTV/DVR video conversion engine designed to integrate directly into third-party systems such as digital evidence management platforms, video analytics solutions, and evidence storage infrastructure. It converts proprietary and otherwise unplayable video formats from CCTV/DVRs, body-worn cameras, dashcams, mobile devices, drones, and other sources while preserving original video quality and relevant metadata where possible. It supports batch conversion, configurable conversion settings, automated processing, detailed conversion logs, and forensic preservation of the original files, making it particularly useful for organizations handling large volumes of surveillance evidence.)/Pg 47 0 R/K[8]>>
