<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 278 0 R/E(Smart Tracker FRS by Speech Pro Technologies is an AI-powered facial recognition, biometric identification, and video analytics platform designed for real-time public security. It can track subjects across multiple CCTV streams, build geolocated movement routes, perform face searches on live or uploaded video/images, and generate customizable real-time alerts and automated reports. The platform supports large-scale deployments with 10,000+ CCTV cameras and databases containing millions of face records, with retrospective search, filtering, multi-user web access, REST API integration, and flexible CPU/GPU processing.)/Pg 47 0 R/K[10]>>
