<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 280 0 R/E(Amped FIVE is a comprehensive forensic image and video enhancement and analysis software designed for law enforcement, forensic laboratories, government, military, and investigative teams. It supports CCTV/DVR, body-camera, and other image/video formats, with more than 140 filters and tools for video conversion, restoration, enhancement, deblurring, stabilization, super-resolution, perspective correction, object tracking, measurement, and metadata/codec analysis. Investigators can also annotate and redact footage, combine multiple sources, export processed evidence, and automatically generate detailed scientific reports documenting the processing steps, settings, and algorithms for repeatable and court-defensible analysis. )/Pg 49 0 R/K[3]>>
