745 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 280 0 R/E(Amped Replay is an easy-to-use forensic video player and first-level analysis tool for police investigators and frontline teams. It can play and convert proprietary footage from CCTV/DVRs, body cameras, dashcams, drones, mobile phones, and other sources, while providing quick video correction, motion detection, annotation, bookmarking, redaction, and evidence export. Its non-destructive workflow preserves the original evidence and generates detailed reports documenting processing, annotations, and redactions. Replay can also export projects directly to Amped FIVE for deeper forensic video analysis.)/Pg 49 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

