747 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 280 0 R/E(MOBILedit Camera Ballistics is a specialized digital image source-identification and forensic verification tool that determines whether a photograph was captured by a specific camera. Instead of relying only on EXIF metadata, it analyzes the camera sensor\220s unique PRNU/pattern-noise fingerprint and compares it with the image under investigation. Investigators can create a sensor fingerprint from reference photographs, analyze questioned images, and generate detailed PDF forensic reports containing match probability, correlation, camera details, GPS data, and other analysis results. It can also be combined with MOBILedit Forensic to distinguish photos actually captured by a phone from downloaded, shared, or received images.)/Pg 49 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

