<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 282 0 R/E(Amped Authenticate is a specialized forensic image, video, and deepfake authentication solution used to verify the integrity, authenticity, source, and processing history of digital media. It provides 40+ forensic tools and filters for metadata and file-structure analysis, tampering localization, compression analysis, camera/source identification using PRNU, and AI-assisted deepfake detection. Its dedicated video mode also supports frame/GOP analysis, macroblock and motion-vector analysis, double-compression detection, continuity analysis, and video source identification. Investigators can compare evidence with reference media and generate customizable, scientifically supported forensic reports documenting the analysis and results.)/Pg 51 0 R/K[4]>>
