<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 282 0 R/E(pi-authentify by Pi Lab is an AI-powered deepfake detection and media authentication platform designed to identify manipulated videos, images, and audio. It uses forensic-grade AI to provide frame- and segment-level authenticity analysis, explainable detection results, real-time verification, and tampering localization. The platform supports API/SDK integration, multilingual and multi-format analysis, on-premises or cloud deployment, and court-ready forensic reports, making it suitable for law enforcement, forensic laboratories, defence, BFSI, and enterprise investigations.)/Pg 51 0 R/K[7]>>
