<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 284 0 R/E(Equinox is a comprehensive TV, Radio, OTT, and digital media monitoring and recording platform designed for broadcasters, media organizations, and monitoring agencies. It provides 24/7 compliance recording, media archiving, content search, audio/video detection, logo detection, thumbnail-based navigation, ratings analysis, and multi-channel monitoring. Equinox can also monitor OTT and IP streams, support centralized remote configuration, and scale into a logger farm for higher recording capacity. Its Multiviewer module adds real-time monitoring, alerts, SCTE, bandwidth, audio-loudness, and QoE/QoS monitoring capabilities.)/Pg 53 0 R/K[4]>>
