<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 284 0 R/E(Social Network harvester by Maltego Evidence is a specialized social media investigation and evidence preservation platform that helps investigators collect, preserve, analyze, and visualize publicly available social-media data from multiple platforms. It provides a unified interface for large-scale data collection, account linking, social-network analysis, pattern discovery, target profiling, evidence preservation, and detailed reporting. Investigators can store evidence locally, maintain a clear chain of original evidence, collaborate with other teams, and export reports. The platform is designed to collect publicly available data without bypassing security measures or accessing private content.)/Pg 53 0 R/K[7]>>
