790 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 286 0 R/E(MOBILedit Cloud Forensic is a cloud evidence acquisition and forensic reporting solution that helps investigators collect data from cloud storage, social networks, messaging platforms, email, and other online services. Supports token-based, username/password authentication, concurrent extraction from multiple cloud accounts, full file-structure downloads, filtering, and customizable forensic reports in PDF, HTML, XML, UFDR, and Excel formats. It can work directly with MOBILedit Forensic PRO by using credentials or tokens recovered from mobile devices, or operate as a standalone solution for authorized cloud investigations. Supported services include Google Drive, Dropbox, OneDrive, Box, Facebook, Instagram, LinkedIn, Slack, Microsoft Teams, Skype, Gmail, Outlook, and others)/Pg 55 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

791 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 286 0 R/E(43)/Pg 55 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

792 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 286 0 R/T(MAGNET AXIOM CLOUD)/E(MAGNET AXIOM CLOUD)/Pg 55 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

793 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 286 0 R/E(Magnet AXIOM Cloud is a cloud forensics solution that helps investigators collect and analyze evidence from cloud services and online accounts. It enables investigators to bring cloud-based evidence into a forensic case, correlate it with mobile and computer evidence, and use AXIOM\220s search, filtering, artifact analysis, timeline, and visualization capabilities to identify relevant information. This allows investigators to build a more complete picture by connecting cloud activity with data from devices and other digital sources within a single investigation workflow.)/Pg 55 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

794 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 286 0 R/T(OXYGEN CLOUD EXTRACTOR)/E(OXYGEN CLOUD EXTRACTOR)/Pg 55 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

795 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 286 0 R/E(Oxygen Forensics Cloud Extractor is a comprehensive cloud forensics solution that enables investigators to collect evidence from a wide range of cloud services, including messaging platforms, social media, iCloud, Google services, travel platforms, device accounts, drones, IoT devices, and fitness applications. It supports rapid extraction, credential and token collection, encrypted WhatsApp backup decryption, and QR-based acquisition for supported services. Collected cloud data can then be analyzed using timelines, social-link analysis, location information, image and facial categorization, helping investigators correlate cloud evidence and uncover connections across multiple sources.)/Pg 55 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

796 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 286 0 R/T(XRY CLOUD)/E(XRY CLOUD)/Pg 55 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

797 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 286 0 R/E(XRY Cloud is a cloud forensics solution that enables authorized investigators to recover digital evidence stored beyond the physical mobile device, including data from services such as Facebook, Google, iCloud, Twitter, Snapchat, WhatsApp, and Instagram. It can use app tokens recovered during XRY mobile extraction to access supported cloud data, and it also supports external cloud recovery when the physical device is not available. Recovered cloud evidence can be combined into an XRY Case File, keeping mobile and cloud evidence together for investigation and analysis. )/Pg 55 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

