endobj

802 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 287 0 R/E(Cellebrite Physical Analyzer is a comprehensive digital forensic analysis platform for examining evidence extracted from mobile devices, applications, and cloud sources. It enables investigators to decode and analyze application data, recover deleted content, build timelines, visualize relationships, and correlate evidence from multiple sources. For cloud forensics, Physical Analyzer can analyze cloud-derived evidence and backups, including data from supported cloud services and applications, allowing investigators to combine cloud artifacts with mobile extractions for a broader investigative picture. It also provides advanced search, filtering, visualization, artifact correlation, and reporting capabilities to help identify communications, locations, accounts, activities, and connections across the collected evidence. )/Pg 56 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

