endobj

805 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 287 0 R/E(MD-CLOUD by GMD-Soft is a dedicated cloud forensic extraction and analysis software designed to collect and examine evidence from cloud accounts and online services. It supports services including Google, iCloud, Samsung Cloud, Naver Cloud, OneDrive, Baidu, Evernote, Twitter, and IMAP/POP3, along with cloud data from supported IoT devices. The solution supports multiple authentication methods such as ID/password, CAPTCHA, two-step verification, and credential-based authentication, as well as web capture when API-based acquisition is unavailable. Investigators can monitor acquisitions in real time, preview and filter cloud evidence, verify integrity using MD5/SHA-256 hashing, and generate PDF and Excel reports. MD-CLOUD can also work with MD-RED to acquire cloud data using credentials identified during forensic analysis.)/Pg 56 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

