<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 287 0 R/T(ELCOMSOFT CLOUD EXPLORER)/E(ELCOMSOFT CLOUD EXPLORER)/Pg 56 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

807 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 287 0 R/E(Elcomsoft Cloud eXplorer \(ECX\) is a cloud forensics solution designed to help investigators collect, access, and analyze evidence stored in cloud accounts. It can acquire supported data from services such as Google Accounts, Microsoft accounts, and Apple iCloud, including emails, contacts, calendars, photos, documents, and other user information. ECX helps forensic teams conduct remote cloud investigations efficiently while organizing acquired data for detailed examination and reporting, making it valuable for law enforcement, corporate investigations, and digital forensic laboratories.)/Pg 56 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

