819 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 289 0 R/E(SocialNet by Shadow-Dragon is an OSINT-based social media investigation and analysis tool that helps investigators identify aliases, uncover relationships, and map networks across publicly available social-media data. It provides identity resolution, cross-platform correlation, digital breadcrumbs, network visualization, geographic insights, and near-real-time analysis, helping investigators trace connections, behavioral patterns, and online activity. It is suited for law enforcement, government, corporate security, fraud investigations, and cyber threat intelligence, particularly for criminal investigations, threat assessments, human trafficking, and cyber-enabled crime.)/Pg 58 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

