endobj

822 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 289 0 R/E(Horizon Monitor by Shadow-Dragon is a continuous OSINT monitoring and intelligence platform that helps investigators track people, keywords, topics, and investigative themes across publicly available online sources. It automates recurring searches, detects new mentions, emerging risks, behavioral changes, and potential threats, and provides configurable alerts based on investigative relevance. It is designed for law enforcement, government, corporate security, fraud and risk, and cyber threat intelligence teams, helping them move from one-time searches to continuous intelligence monitoring.)/Pg 58 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

823 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 289 0 R/T(HORIZON IDENTITY)/E(HORIZON IDENTITY)/Pg 58 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

824 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 289 0 R/E(Horizon Identity by Shadow-Dragon is an OSINT-based digital identity investigation and rapid-triage platform that helps investigators assess and validate people, aliases, and online identities using a single starting point such as a username, email address, phone number, or alias. It searches 600+ publicly available sources, correlates digital identities across platforms, and helps investigators quickly validate genuine connections, eliminate false leads, and uncover relevant digital footprints. It is designed for law enforcement, government, corporate security, fraud and risk, finance, and cyber threat intelligence investigations. )/Pg 58 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

