826 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 289 0 R/E(ESPY Reverse Phone Number Lookup is an OSINT and phone intelligence solution that enriches a phone number with publicly available identity and risk information. It can identify line type and carrier, country and regional location, active status, reputation and spam indicators, linked social profiles, usernames, and other digital footprints across global sources. Supporting 195+ countries, the platform provides structured results through a REST API/JSON, making it suitable for identity verification, fraud detection, background research, and investigative intelligence workflows.)/Pg 58 0 R/K[12]>>
