832 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 290 0 R/E(ESPY OSINT Investigation Center is a centralized AI-powered WEBINT/OSINT investigation platform that supports the complete intelligence workflow\204from data collection and automated profiling to analysis, monitoring, and reporting. Investigators can start with a phone number, email, name, social ID, group, hashtag, or other data point, then automatically gather information from open sources, social media, and surface, deep, and dark web sources. It provides identity profiling, social-network/link analysis, sentiment and timeline analysis, online community monitoring, dark-web monitoring, target identification, and automated alerts, helping law enforcement, national security, corporate intelligence, and financial investigation teams build comprehensive intelligence profiles.)/Pg 59 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

