endobj

835 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 290 0 R/E(Port Security Center by ESPY is a centralized maritime OSINT and intelligence platform designed to monitor and investigate vessels, containers, and personnel. Investigators can enter a ship name or MMSI/IMO number to automatically gather intelligence from multiple open sources, generate vessel profiles, review ownership and traffic history, and monitor container locations and ownership. It also supports crew and personnel profiling, social-link analysis, anomaly detection, ongoing monitoring, and automated alerts, helping port authorities, law enforcement, and national-security teams identify potential maritime threats and suspicious activity.)/Pg 59 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

836 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 290 0 R/T(GEO PROFILER)/E(GEO PROFILER)/Pg 59 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

837 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 290 0 R/E(Geo Profiler by ESPY is a location-based OSINT intelligence platform that identifies and profiles publicly available social-media information associated with people within a specified geographic area. Investigators can define a target location or polygon and apply parameters such as age and gender, while the platform performs continuous geo-monitoring, AI-based face recognition, social-link analysis, profiling, and smart alerting. Collected intelligence can be imported or exported to other investigation systems, making it useful for law enforcement, national security, public safety, corporate intelligence, and sensitive-location monitoring.)/Pg 59 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

838 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 290 0 R/T(MASS PROFILER)/E(MASS PROFILER)/Pg 59 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

839 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 290 0 R/E(Mass Profiler is a large-scale OSINT and population profiling platform designed to generate intelligence profiles of people within a defined geographic area. It uses publicly available online and social-media data to identify and analyze large populations, social profiles, demographic characteristics, digital identities, relationships, and behavioral patterns at scale. The platform helps investigators and intelligence teams discover trends, connections, groups, and potential risks across a target area, supporting applications in law enforcement, national security, public safety, corporate intelligence, and financial investigations. ESPY positions Mass Profiler as a complementary solution to its Geo Profiler, extending location-based intelligence from individual target profiling to population-level analysis.)/Pg 59 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

