845 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 291 0 R/E(Email Lookup by ESPY is an email intelligence and identity verification solution that turns an email address into a broader digital profile. It can verify mailbox and domain status, provider information, geographic signals, reputation and risk indicators, breach history, associated names and usernames, and linked social/professional profiles across 200+ platforms. It also helps identify disposable or suspicious email accounts and assess the age and depth of an email\220s digital footprint. The platform provides real-time API-based results, making it useful for OSINT investigations, fraud detection, KYC/compliance, cybersecurity, and identity verification.)/Pg 60 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

