848 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 291 0 R/E(Facial Recognition Search by ESPY is an AI-powered facial search and identity intelligence solution that compares an uploaded face against publicly available images across social networks, news sources, professional directories, and other open-web sources. It provides facial similarity scores, matching profile URLs, names and platform information, identity/alias discovery, historical digital-footprint validation, and relationship mapping. The IRBIS AI engine supports API-based searches and can return structured JSON results with confidence scores and source metadata, making it useful for OSINT, identity verification, fraud investigation, and investigative research.)/Pg 60 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

849 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 291 0 R/T(PUBLIC OPINION CENTER)/E(PUBLIC OPINION CENTER)/Pg 60 0 R/K[9]>>
