850 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 291 0 R/E(Public Opinion Center is a WEBINT-based public opinion monitoring and analysis platform that continuously collects and analyzes online conversations around specific topics, events, brands, hashtags, social groups, and profiles. It uses AI to assess sentiment, community opinions, social hierarchies, key influencers, and emerging trends, while supporting continuous monitoring and real-time alerts based on keywords, faces, and social connections. The platform is designed for corporate intelligence, law enforcement, national security, public safety, maritime intelligence, and financial institutions to understand public sentiment and identify emerging threats or opportunities.)/Pg 60 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

