852 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 291 0 R/E(ESPY Name Lookup is an OSINT-based identity intelligence solution that starts with a person\220s name and builds a broader digital identity profile from publicly available sources. It searches 200+ platforms to discover social accounts, usernames, web presence, and associated identity signals, while providing profile URLs, confidence scores, linked emails/phone numbers, web-presence depth, and cross-platform consistency analysis. Investigators can optionally add location or affiliation information to improve accuracy, making it useful for OSINT investigations, KYC, background screening, AML, fraud detection, and identity verification. )/Pg 60 0 R/K[12]>>
