<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 293 0 R/E(Gargoyle Investigator\222 MP by WetStone Labs is an advanced malware discovery and forensic triage solution designed for digital forensic laboratories, law enforcement, and incident response teams. It rapidly identifies malicious and suspicious applications\204including ransomware, Trojans, keyloggers, spyware, rootkits, hacking tools, and anti-forensic software\204helping investigators understand potential criminal activity, intent, and capabilities. It also supports hash-based scanning and comprehensive forensic reporting, making it useful for analyzing seized devices, forensic images, and investigation evidence.)/Pg 62 0 R/K[5]>>
