866 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 293 0 R/E(Gargoyle Enterprise Manager\222 \(GEM\) by WetStone Labs is an enterprise security and threat-detection solution focused on identifying insider threats, unauthorized applications, malicious software, and potentially unwanted programs across network endpoints. It provides proactive endpoint scanning, hash-based threat detection, customizable search criteria, whitelisting, and YARA rule support, along with regularly updated threat-intelligence datasets and detailed reporting. GEM helps organizations detect suspicious tools, unauthorized encryption or steganography software, and potential data-exfiltration activity before they cause significant damage.)/Pg 62 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

867 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 293 0 R/T(EXTERRO FTK CENTRAL)/E(EXTERRO FTK CENTRAL)/Pg 62 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

868 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 293 0 R/E(Exterro FTK Central is a centralized, enterprise-grade digital forensics platform designed to manage live endpoint investigations, remote evidence collection, processing, analysis, review, collaboration, and case management from a unified environment. It enables forensic teams to investigate distributed endpoints, process large volumes of evidence, collaborate across investigators, and maintain controlled, auditable workflows. FTK Central also integrates with cloud/SaaS sources and enterprise security platforms, making it suitable for corporate investigations, incident response, law enforcement, and large-scale forensic laboratories.)/Pg 62 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

869 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 293 0 R/T(EXTERRO FTK ENTERPRISE)/E(EXTERRO FTK ENTERPRISE)/Pg 62 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

870 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 293 0 R/E(Exterro FTK Enterprise is an enterprise digital forensics and remote evidence collection solution that enables investigators to securely acquire and analyze forensic data from remote endpoints without physical access. It supports targeted, forensically sound collection from Windows, Mac, and Linux systems, including devices that are temporarily offline, while its persistent agent enables rapid response across large and distributed environments. FTK Enterprise helps organizations investigate data breaches, intellectual property theft, file tampering, insider threats, and other internal security incidents while reducing the need for device shipping and manual imaging.)/Pg 62 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

