875 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 294 0 R/E(Jamf Now is a cloud-based Apple Mobile Device Management \(MDM\) solution designed mainly for small and medium-sized organizations to set up, manage, and secure Mac, iPhone, iPad, and other Apple devices from a central dashboard. It enables administrators to enroll devices, deploy applications, configure Wi-Fi and email, manage OS updates, maintain device inventory, enforce passcodes and encryption, deploy configuration profiles, and remotely lock or wipe lost devices. Its Blueprints feature allows administrators to bundle apps, settings, and restrictions and apply them consistently to selected devices.)/Pg 63 0 R/K[4]>>
