<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 295 0 R/E(Jamf Protect is an Apple-focused endpoint security and mobile threat defense solution used by enterprises, government organizations, and other teams to protect Mac, iPhone, iPad, and other supported devices against malware, phishing, risky applications, network threats, and security vulnerabilities. It runs security components on the endpoint and uses Apple\220s native security frameworks to monitor processes, files, downloads, USB activity, and other security events in real time. It analyzes this activity using threat intelligence and behavioral detection, then can block malicious processes, quarantine files, block unsafe websites, detect risky apps or jailbreaks, and generate alerts. Security telemetry can also be forwarded to SIEM platforms such as Splunk or Microsoft Sentinel for investigation)/Pg 64 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

