<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 297 0 R/E(Passware Kit Mobile is a mobile forensic password-recovery solution designed to help investigators decrypt and access protected mobile device backups and encrypted evidence. It supports recovery of passwords and encryption keys from various mobile platforms and backup formats, enabling forensic professionals to access otherwise inaccessible data for investigation and analysis. It is particularly useful for law enforcement, digital forensic laboratories, and incident response teams handling password-protected mobile evidence.)/Pg 66 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

903 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 297 0 R/T(ELCOMSOFT MOBILE FORENSIC BUNDLE)/E(ELCOMSOFT MOBILE FORENSIC BUNDLE)/Pg 66 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

904 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 297 0 R/E(Elcomsoft Mobile Forensic Bundle \(EMFB\) is a comprehensive mobile forensic toolkit that enables investigators to perform physical, logical, and over-the-air acquisition of smartphones and tablets. It supports forensic extraction and analysis of iOS devices, iCloud and Google account data, recovery of mobile backup passwords, and decryption of encrypted backups using GPU acceleration. The bundle combines tools such as Elcomsoft iOS Forensic Toolkit, Phone Breaker, Phone Viewer, and Cloud eXplorer, making it suitable for law enforcement, government agencies, corporate investigations, and digital forensic laboratories.)/Pg 66 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

