906 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 297 0 R/E(MOBILedit Forensic ULTRA is an advanced mobile forensic solution designed for law enforcement, military, and forensic professionals to access and examine protected data from smartphones, smartwatches, and cloud sources. It offers security bypassing, password detection, brute-force and chipset-based techniques, GPU acceleration, FDE/FBE decryption, exploit support, and compatibility with the latest Android devices, enabling deeper forensic access during authorized investigations.)/Pg 66 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

