908 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 297 0 R/E(PC-3000 Mobile PRO is a specialized hardware-software mobile forensic recovery solution designed for law-enforcement use, particularly for challenging locked, damaged, or inaccessible Android smartphones and tablets. It uses low-level access techniques to recover evidence when conventional extraction methods are insufficient, including chipset-level access, Chip-off methods, standard interfaces, and previously created image files. It can provide access to devices protected by modern encryption and from devices that may not boot normally, depending on the device and case. The recovered data can then be exported for further forensic analysis with third-party tools.)/Pg 66 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

