915 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 298 0 R/E(Elcomsoft Premium Forensic Bundle \(EPFB\) is an all-in-one digital forensic suite that combines ElcomSoft\220s desktop, mobile, password recovery, decryption, and evidence analysis tools in a single package. It supports logical, physical, and over-the-air mobile acquisition, cloud data extraction from Apple, Microsoft, and Google services, and recovery of deleted evidence. The bundle also provides password recovery and decryption capabilities for Microsoft Office, PDF, ZIP/RAR, BitLocker, PGP, VeraCrypt, TrueCrypt, macOS Keychain, Windows/macOS passwords, and numerous other formats, making it a comprehensive solution for law enforcement, government agencies, corporate investigators, and forensic laboratories.)/Pg 67 0 R/K[6]>>
