917 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 298 0 R/E(Elcomsoft Desktop Forensic Bundle \(EDFB\) is an all-in-one password recovery and decryption suite designed for digital forensic investigators, government agencies, and corporate security teams. It combines ElcomSoft\220s leading desktop password-recovery tools to unlock documents, decrypt archives, and access encrypted containers across hundreds of formats, including Microsoft Office, PDF, ZIP/RAR, BitLocker, PGP, TrueCrypt, VeraCrypt, Windows/macOS passwords, and macOS Keychain. With GPU acceleration, distributed password recovery across up to 10,000 computers, remote management, and detailed job tracking, EDFB enables fast and scalable recovery of protected digital evidence.)/Pg 67 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

