919 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 298 0 R/E(Elcomsoft iOS Forensic Toolkit \(EIFT\) is an advanced forensic acquisition solution designed to extract and analyze data from iPhone, iPad, and other iOS devices. The toolkit supports full file system extraction, logical acquisition, keychain extraction, password recovery, and decryption of protected data, enabling investigators to access evidence that may not be available through standard forensic methods. It also provides access to system logs, application data, browser history, messages, and other critical artifacts, making it a powerful tool for law enforcement, digital forensic laboratories, and incident response teams conducting iOS investigations.)/Pg 67 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

