921 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 298 0 R/E(Elcomsoft Phone Breaker \(EPB\) is a digital forensic solution designed to help investigators acquire and decrypt data from cloud services and mobile device backups. It supports forensic access to Apple iCloud data, iOS backups, Microsoft accounts, and other supported cloud-stored evidence, including contacts, messages, photos, documents, and application data. EPB is particularly useful for law enforcement, corporate investigations, and forensic laboratories where investigators need to recover evidence from cloud accounts and protected backups.)/Pg 67 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

