<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 299 0 R/E(Passware Kit Ultimate is all-in-one forensic decryption and password-recovery solution designed for law enforcement, government agencies, forensic laboratories, and corporate investigation teams. It combines mobile forensics, password recovery, full-disk decryption, device decryption, and live-memory analysis in a single platform. The solution supports 420+ file types and 1,150+ mobile devices, with capabilities for recovering passwords, decrypting BitLocker, FileVault, VeraCrypt, TrueCrypt, APFS, LUKS and other encrypted volumes, as well as extracting encryption keys from live memory. GPU acceleration and distributed computing further enable high-speed password recovery across multiple computers.)/Pg 68 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

928 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 299 0 R/E(ELCOMSOFT DISTRIBUTED PASSWORD RECOVERY)/Pg 68 0 R/K[6]>>
