<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 301 0 R/E(ADF Mobile Device Investigator\256 \(MDI\) is a rapid mobile forensic triage and acquisition solution designed for front-line law enforcement, analysts, and forensic examiners. It enables fast collection and preview of evidence from iOS and Android devices, supports multiple-device scanning, real-time keyword searching, artifact profiling, image-based classification, relationship analysis, and advanced logical acquisition. MDI also provides screen/video capture with OCR, hash and PhotoDNA searching, evidence tagging, and exportable HTML, CSV, and PDF reports, helping investigators quickly identify and document relevant mobile evidence in the field.)/Pg 70 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

945 0 obj
