946 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 301 0 R/E(Elcomsoft Quick Triage \(EQT\) is a rapid digital forensic triage solution designed to collect, process, and analyze critical evidence from Windows computers during the early stages of an investigation. It extracts system information, user activity, browser history, communications, documents, credentials, USB activity, Windows Event Logs, Prefetch, Shimcache, SRUM, and other important forensic artefacts. EQT provides on-the-fly indexing, global search, timeline analysis, memory acquisition, Windows password recovery, and an open VHDX evidence container, allowing investigators to quickly identify relevant evidence in both field and laboratory investigations.)/Pg 70 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

947 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 301 0 R/E(ADF TRIAGE-INVESTIGATOR)/Pg 70 0 R/K[7]>>
