948 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 301 0 R/E(ADF Triage-Investigator is a field-deployable digital forensic triage solution designed to provide fast, forensically sound access to court-defensible evidence from computers and digital storage. It can investigate live and powered-off systems, forensic images, folders, network shares, and multiple file systems, while offering RAM capture, powerful boot capabilities, automated imaging, hash and keyword matching, timeline analysis, video preview, deleted-image recovery, and BitLocker/FileVault2 support. Its intuitive interface and automated prosecution-ready reporting help investigators rapidly collect and analyze evidence, reduce forensic backlogs, and collaborate effectively with forensic laboratories.)/Pg 70 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

