960 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 302 0 R/E(Detego Field Triage is a portable digital forensic triage solution designed to rapidly identify investigation-relevant data from computers, laptops, servers, and removable media without requiring lengthy forensic extraction and analysis. It uses keyword searching, hash matching, automation, and a patented red-amber-green alert system to help investigators quickly assess evidence in time-critical situations. With Xpress HashScan, CAID and Project VIC integration, customizable investigation profiles, and a user-friendly interface, Field Triage is suitable for law enforcement, military, corporate investigations, and specialized investigations such as fraud, human trafficking, terrorism, and CSAM/IIOC cases.)/Pg 71 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

961 0 obj
