endobj

962 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 302 0 R/E(Belkasoft T is a portable digital forensic triage solution designed for first responders and investigators who need to quickly identify and collect critical evidence from Windows systems at an incident scene. It can detect 1,500+ computer, mobile, and cloud artefacts, including emails, chats, browser data, system settings, mobile backups, virtual machines, and memory files. The solution supports RAM acquisition, hash-based detection, skin-tone image detection, selective evidence acquisition, real-time analysis, and partial or complete result export, allowing investigators to rapidly obtain leads and create evidence images for deeper examination in Belkasoft X.)/Pg 71 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

963 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 302 0 R/T(MAGNET OUTRIDER)/E(MAGNET OUTRIDER)/Pg 71 0 R/K[10]>>
