964 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 302 0 R/E(Magnet Outrider is a rapid digital forensic triage solution designed to quickly examine Windows and Mac computers, iOS and Android devices, and external drives in the field or laboratory. It can identify actionable evidence such as messages, contacts, browser history, user activity, illicit applications, usernames, and CSAM without requiring a full forensic extraction. Key capabilities include multi-device scanning, keyword and URL searches, MD5/MAG24 hash matching, automated CSAM detection, live system artifact collection, RAM capture, screenshots, and encryption-key discovery, enabling investigators to obtain critical leads within minutes.)/Pg 71 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

