966 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 302 0 R/E(Cyber Triage is an automated DFIR and cyber incident investigation platform designed for SOCs, MSSPs, incident response teams, and law enforcement. It combines EDR telemetry and forensic artifacts, automatically scores and prioritizes suspicious evidence, and analyzes large datasets to help investigators identify relevant activity quickly. Key capabilities include automated evidence collection, artifact prioritization, attack-scenario analysis, EDR/SOAR integration, collaborative investigations, and AI-assisted investigations, with deployment options for laptops, cloud, or on-premises environments.)/Pg 71 0 R/K[13]>>
