982 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 304 0 R/E(Anubhooti AAA5000 is an audio authentication solution designed to detect deepfake/synthesized voices and audio tampering or modification. It analyzes spectrograms and multiple audio characteristics, including LPC discontinuities, copy-paste edits, sampling frequency, spectral changes, ENF variation, and background inconsistencies. The system automates these tests and generates a detailed report, while also providing basic audio-processing tools and offline operation for forensic investigations.)/Pg 73 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

983 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 304 0 R/T(ASL5000 - SPEAKER IDENTIFICATION)/E(ASL5000 - SPEAKER IDENTIFICATION)/Pg 73 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

984 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 304 0 R/E(Anubhooti ASL5000 is a forensic speaker identification and verification system designed to analyze, compare, and verify speakers based on their voice characteristics. It combines formant-based automatic speaker verification with manual comparison tools and can match suspect and control word pairs while generating detailed analysis reports. The system includes a comprehensive speech laboratory, word segregation, two-speaker diarization, noise cancellation, SNR/HNR measurement, cepstral and spectrum analysis, waveform-based IPA annotation, and advanced audio filtering. Its offline operation and support for different languages and accents make it suitable for forensic voice examination, law enforcement, and investigative audio analysis.)/Pg 73 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

