endobj

991 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 305 0 R/E(Anubhooti Call Audit & Speech Analytics is a forensic speech-analysis solution that converts call recordings into punctuated text with speaker identification and timestamps. It distinguishes agent and client conversations, calculates the agent\220s speaking rate and tone, and uses emotion analysis to identify indicators such as aggressive speech based on vocal characteristics. These combined parameters can then be used for automated call auditing, quality assessment, and behavioral analysis.)/Pg 74 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

992 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 305 0 R/E(SPEECH-TO-TEXT SYSTEM)/Pg 74 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

993 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 305 0 R/E(Anubhooti Speech-to-Text System is a speech analysis solution that converts audio recordings into searchable, punctuated text with speaker identification and timestamps. It supports speaker diarization to distinguish agent and client, calculates the agent\220s words-per-minute speaking rate and vocal tone, and uses emotion analysis to identify indicators such as aggressive speech. The system can process audio metadata and generate text outputs in Word format, making it suitable for call auditing, forensic audio analysis, investigations, and speech analytics.)/Pg 74 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

994 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 305 0 R/T(ADAD5000 - DEEPFAKE AUDIO DETECTION)/E(ADAD5000 - DEEPFAKE AUDIO DETECTION)/Pg 74 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

995 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 305 0 R/E(Anubhooti Deepfake Audio Detection System is a forensic solution designed to identify AI-generated, synthesized, or cloned voices by analyzing time- and frequency-based audio artifacts. It uses Metadata Analysis, Time Artifacts, Frequency Artifacts, zero and silence discontinuity, histogram analysis, and Copy-Paste detection to identify potential manipulation. The system also supports speaker verification using a control voice, automated testing with PDF/Word reporting, and essential audio-processing functions, with complete offline operation for forensic investigations.)/Pg 74 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

996 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 305 0 R/T(ANC3000 - NOISE CANCELLATION & SPEECH ENHANCEMENT  SOLUTION)/E(ANC3000 - NOISE CANCELLATION & SPEECH ENHANCEMENT  SOLUTION)/Pg 74 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

997 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 305 0 R/E(Anubhooti ANC3000 is an automatic noise-cancellation and speech-enhancement solution designed to clean noisy or disputed audio for further forensic analysis. It measures SNR, automatically tracks noise profiles, and uses multiband spectral subtraction to reduce background noise. The system also provides LPF, HPF, BPF, and BRF filters, pitch shifting, speech-to-text, speech analysis, word comparison, and speech enhancement, supporting both mono and stereo audio for forensic speech and audio investigations.)/Pg 74 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

