1002 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 306 0 R/E(SpeechPro IKAR Lab 3 is a comprehensive forensic audio and media examination suite designed for forensic experts and law enforcement agencies. It combines advanced audio analysis, speaker comparison, speaker diarization, noise reduction, speech-to-text, audio spoofing and deepfake detection, along with video and facial forensics. The system supports transcription in 21 languages, speaker separation of up to 10 speakers, word-level alignment, detection of editing and tampering, and forensic-grade speaker comparison from recordings as short as 5 seconds.)/Pg 75 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

1003 0 obj
