1004 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 306 0 R/E(SpeechPro VoiceKey by speech Recognition Center is a biometric identity platform that uses AI-powered voice biometrics to remotely verify and authenticate individuals through their voice. It analyzes more than 70 voice biometric parameters and can perform text-independent, language-independent verification using only a few seconds of speech. VoiceKey also supports speaker verification, fraud and voice-fake detection, speaker diarization, and speech recognition, making it suitable for secure digital services, contact centers, government applications, and fraud prevention.)/Pg 75 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

