1008 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 306 0 R/E(Phonexia Voice Inspector is a desktop forensic voice-analysis solution designed for police and forensic experts for speaker comparison, identification, and deepfake detection. It offers 98%+ speaker identification accuracy, 1:1, 1:N, and M:N voice comparison, language-, text-, and channel-independent analysis, and deepfake detection from as little as 3 seconds of speech. Additional features include user-managed population sets, Voice Activity Detection, automatic speaker diarization, phoneme recognition, spectrogram visualization, forensic-ready reporting, and secure 100% on-premises processing for reliable forensic investigations.)/Pg 75 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

1009 0 obj
