endobj

1010 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 306 0 R/E(Phonexia Voice Guardian is a voice-biometric fraud prevention solution for contact centers that provides real-time and post-call protection against voice fraud and AI-generated deepfakes. It passively authenticates genuine customers from less than two seconds of speech, detects synthetic or cloned voices, and uses speaker clustering to identify fraudsters operating across multiple accounts or identities. It also provides real-time alerts for call-center agents, dedicated fraud-analysis tools, strong data privacy and encryption controls, and regional data hosting, helping organizations reduce voice-based fraud while maintaining customer convenience and control over sensitive voice data.)/Pg 75 0 R/K[12]>>
