<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 309 0 R/E(MOBILedit Smartwatch Forensics enables investigators to extract and analyze valuable evidence from smartwatches, including health and heartbeat data, GPS/location history, messages, emails, notifications, and activity records. It supports major brands such as Apple Watch, Garmin, Samsung, and TCL, helping investigators reconstruct timelines and track movements even when a paired smartphone is unavailable or its data is deleted. Data can be acquired through full or selective extraction and presented in PDF, Excel, HTML, or UFDR formats, with backups available for future examination.)/Pg 78 0 R/K[4]>>
